    <tr style="vertical-align: top;">
     <td style="width: 81pt;"> <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;"><b><a id="item2" title="item2" href="#"></a><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">ITEM 2.</span></b></p> </td>
     <td> <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;"><b><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">PROPERTIES.&#160;</span></b></p> </td>
    </tr>

   </tbody>
  </table>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">The Company's executive office is located at 1400 Prospect Avenue in Helena, Montana.&#160;The following table provides information on the Compan<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">y's 31&#160;pro</span>perties as of December 31, 2025, including&#160;locations by city, as well as whether they are owned or leased.&#160;</p>
