  <p style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt;">
   <tbody>
    <tr style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 9pt;">
     <td style="width: 22.4%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 9pt; vertical-align: bottom;"> <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 9pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(1) </sup>Excludes loans held-for-sale.</p> </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
     <td style="width: 22.4%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 9pt; vertical-align: bottom;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(2)</sup>&#160;Deferred loan fees, net included in individual loan buckets above for the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023.</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
     <td style="width: 22.4%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 9pt; vertical-align: bottom;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(3)</sup>&#160;Allowance for credit losses for the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023; allowance for loan losses for the years ended December 31, 2022 and 2021.</td>
