  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(1)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</sup>Includes loans held-for-sale.</p>
  <div>
   &#160;
  </div>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><b><span style="text-decoration: underline; "><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Results of Operations</span></span></b><b><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;</span></b></p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><b>&#160;</b></p>
