  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">The information in the Proxy Statement set forth under the caption of &#8220;Proposal 2 &#8211; Ratification of Appointment of Independent Registered Public Accounting Firm&#8221; is incorporated herein by reference.</p>
