  <p style="margin: 0pt 7.2pt; text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><b><a id="equity" title="equity" href="#"></a>EAGLE BANCORP MONTANA, INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</b></p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt 7.2pt; text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF CHANGES IN SHAREHOLDERS&#8217; EQUITY</span></p>
