   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Proceeds from sales of available-for-sale securities and the associated gross realized gains and losses were as follows:</p>
