   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">At <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>, securities with a fair value of $<ix:nonFraction id="c141590805" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_PledgedStatusAxis-AssetPledgedAsCollateralWithoutRightMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DebtSecuritiesAvailableForSaleExcludingAccruedInterest" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">19,976,000</ix:nonFraction><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;and $$<ix:nonFraction id="c141590806" contextRef="i_2024-12-31_PledgedStatusAxis-AssetPledgedAsCollateralWithoutRightMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DebtSecuritiesAvailableForSaleExcludingAccruedInterest" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">22,892,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively, were pledged to secure public deposits and for other purposes required or permitted by law.</p>
