   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Included in the above are loans guaranteed by U.S. government agencies totaling $<ix:nonFraction id="c141590818" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_FinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis-CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMember_GuaranteeObligationsByNatureAxis-UnitedStatesDepartmentOfAgricultureRuralDevelopmentMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestBeforeAllowanceForCreditLoss" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">12,091,000</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction id="c141590819" contextRef="i_2024-12-31_FinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis-CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMember_GuaranteeObligationsByNatureAxis-UnitedStatesDepartmentOfAgricultureRuralDevelopmentMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestBeforeAllowanceForCreditLoss" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">16,309,000</ix:nonFraction> at </span><em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;and&#160;</span><em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2024</em><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">, respectively.</span></p>
