   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Interest income recognized on impaired&#160;loans for the year&#160;ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>&#160;was&#160;considered insignificant. Interest payments received on a cash basis related to nonaccrual loans were $<ix:nonFraction id="c141590841" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="ebmt:InterestReceivedOnPastDueLoansAppliedToPrincipal" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">262,000</ix:nonFraction> at <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025&#160;</em>and $<ix:nonFraction id="c141590842" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="ebmt:InterestReceivedOnPastDueLoansAppliedToPrincipal" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">522,000</ix:nonFraction> at <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2024.</em></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
