   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 53pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 53pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">During the year ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2024, </em>the Company modified <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c141590845">one</span> commercial loan and <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c141590846">two</span> farmland loans. The commercial loan was modified to allow for interest only payments for <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31_FinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis-CommercialPortfolioSegmentMember_FinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis-CommercialLoansMember" name="ebmt:FinancingReceivableModifiedInterestOnlyPaymentsTerm" id="c141590847" format="ixt-sec:durmonth">6</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;months. The loan paid off during the <em style="font: inherit;">fourth</em> quarter of <em style="font: inherit;">2025.</em> The <em style="font: inherit;">first</em> farmland loan was modified by extending the payment for <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c141590851">seven</span> months during the <em style="font: inherit;">second</em> quarter of <em style="font: inherit;">2024.</em> The loan paid off during the <em style="font: inherit;">fourth</em> quarter of <em style="font: inherit;">2024.</em> The <em style="font: inherit;">second</em> farmland loan was modified by consolidating debts and refinancing into a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31_FinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis-CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMember_FinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis-FarmlandLoanMember" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableModifiedWeightedAverageTermIncreaseFromModification" id="c141590857" format="ixt-sec:duryear">15</ix:nonNumeric>-year loan with a variable interest rate adjustable every <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31_FinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis-CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMember_FinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis-FarmlandLoanMember" name="ebmt:FinancingReceivableModifiedAdjustableTerm" id="c141590858" format="ixt-sec:duryear">5</ix:nonNumeric> years. The loan had an amortized cost of $<ix:nonFraction id="c141590859" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31_FinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis-CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMember_FinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis-FarmlandLoanMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableModificationsPostModificationRecordedInvestment2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">188,000</ix:nonFraction> or <ix:nonFraction id="c141590860" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31_FinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis-CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMember_FinancingReceivableRecordedInvestmentByClassOfFinancingReceivableAxis-FarmlandLoanMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableModificationToTotalFinancingReceivablesPercent" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="4">0.12</ix:nonFraction>% of farmland loans at <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025.</em></span></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Loans are granted to directors and officers of the Company in the ordinary course of business on substantially the same terms as those prevailing at the time for comparable transactions with other persons.&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
