   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt;">In addition to the balances included above, available lines of credit w<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">ere $<ix:nonFraction id="c141590863" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="ebmt:FinancingReceivablesAggregateMaximumLoanBalanceOfExtendedCredit" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">333,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;and</span> $<ix:nonFraction id="c141590864" contextRef="i_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="ebmt:FinancingReceivablesAggregateMaximumLoanBalanceOfExtendedCredit" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">358,000</ix:nonFraction> at <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>, respectively, and includes the ending balances from the tables above.&#160;</p>
