   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><b>&#160;</b></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Core deposit intangible assets are amortized on an accelerated basis over their estimated life of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i_2025-12-31_FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis-CoreDepositsMember" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetUsefulLife" id="c141590896" format="ixt-sec:duryear">10</ix:nonNumeric> years. Amortization expense related to intangible asse<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">ts was </span>$<ix:nonFraction id="c141590897" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31_FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis-CoreDepositsMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">1,185,000</ix:nonFraction><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;an</span>d $<ix:nonFraction id="c141590898" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31_FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis-CoreDepositsMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">1,381,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;for the years ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>.</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
