   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">At <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>, the Company he<span style="background-color:#ffffff">ld</span> $<ix:nonFraction id="c141590902" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:TimeDepositsAtOrAboveFDICInsuranceLimit" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">734,618,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;<span style="background-color:#ffffff">and</span> $<ix:nonFraction id="c141590903" contextRef="i_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:TimeDepositsAtOrAboveFDICInsuranceLimit" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">632,951,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, in deposit accounts that met or exceeded the Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation (&#8220;FDIC&#8221;) requirements of <em style="font: inherit;">$250,000</em> and greater.</p>
