   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">The Company believes, based upon the available evidence, that all deferred tax assets will be realized in the normal course of operati<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">ons. Accordingly, these assets have <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> been reduced by a valuation allowance.</span></p>
