   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">The&#160;Bank&#8217;s actual capital amounts and ratios as of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2024</em> are presented in the table below and all of the ratios, with the exception of the Tier <em style="font: inherit;">1</em> capital to adjusted total average assets ratio, include the capital conservation buffer of <ix:nonFraction id="c141591043" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:BankingRegulationCapitalConservationBufferCommonEquityTierOneRiskBasedCapitalActual" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">2.50</ix:nonFraction>%.</p>
