eft: 0pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#160;</td><td style="width: 9%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ix:nonFraction id="c141590097" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis-ShareRepurchaseProgram2025Member" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockSharesAcquired" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">25,000</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-bottom: 3px; margin-left: 0pt;">&#160;</td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><em style="font: inherit;">&#160;</em></td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-bottom: 3px;">&#160;</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   </ix:nonNumeric>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 53pt; text-indent: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 53pt;">On <em style="font: inherit;"> April 18, 2024, </em>Eagle's Board of Directors authorized the repurchase of up to <ix:nonFraction id="c141591060" contextRef="i_2024-04-08_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis-StockRepurchaseProgram2024Member" unitRef="Share" name="srt:StockRepurchaseProgramNumberOfSharesAuthorizedToBeRepurchased" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">400,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of its common stock beginning <em style="font: inherit;"> May 1, 2024 (</em>the <em style="font: inherit;">"2024</em> Repurchase Plan"). Under the <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em> Repurchase Plan, shares <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>be purchased by the Company on the open market or in privately negotiated transactions. The extent to which the company repurchases its shares and the timing of such repurchase will depend on market conditions and other corporate considerations. <ix:nonFraction id="c141591063" contextRef="d_2024-04-01_2024-06-30_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis-StockRepurchaseProgram2024Member" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockSharesAcquired" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="-3">No</ix:nonFraction> shares were purchased during the <em style="font: inherit;">second</em> or <em style="font: inherit;">third</em> quarter of <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em> under this plan. During the <em style="font: inherit;">fourth</em> quarter of <em style="font: inherit;">2024,</em> <ix:nonFraction id="c141591069" contextRef="d_2024-10-01_2024-12-31_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis-StockRepurchaseProgram2024Member" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockSharesAcquired" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">25,000</ix:nonFraction> shares were purchased under this plan at an average price of $<ix:nonFraction id="c141591070" contextRef="d_2024-10-01_2024-12-31_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis-StockRepurchaseProgram2024Member" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockAcquiredAverageCostPerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">16.74</ix:nonFraction> per share. During the <em style="font: inherit;">first</em> quarter of <em style="font: inherit;">2025,</em> <ix:nonFraction id="c141591073" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-03-31_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis-StockRepurchaseProgram2024Member" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockSharesAcquired" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">50,000</ix:nonFraction> shares were purchased under this plan at an average price of $<ix:nonFraction id="c141591074" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-03-31_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis-StockRepurchaseProgram2024Member" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockAcquiredAverageCostPerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">15.11</ix:nonFraction> per share. During the <em style="font: inherit;">second</em> quarter of <em style="font: inherit;">2025,</em> <ix:nonFraction id="c141591077" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis-StockRepurchaseProgram2024Member" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockSharesAcquired" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">25,000</ix:nonFraction> shares were purchased under this plan at an average price of $<ix:nonFraction id="c141591078" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis-StockRepurchaseProgram2024Member" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockAcquiredAverageCostPerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">16.34</ix:nonFraction> per share. The plan expired on <em style="font: inherit;"> May 1, 2025.</em></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 45pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 53pt;">On <em style="font: inherit;"> April 20, 2023, </em>Eagle's Board of Directors authorized the repurchase of up to <ix:nonFraction id="c141591079" contextRef="i_2023-04-20_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis-StockRepurchaseProgram2023Member" unitRef="Share" name="srt:StockRepurchaseProgramNumberOfSharesAuthorizedToBeRepurchased" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">400,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of its common stock beginning <em style="font: inherit;"> May 1, 2023 (</em>the <em style="font: inherit;">"2023</em> Repurchase Plan"). Under the <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em>&#160;Repurchase Plan, shares <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>be purchased by the Company on the open market or in privately negotiated transactions. The extent to which the company repurchases its shares and the timing of such repurchase will depend on market conditions and other corporate considerations. During the <em style="font: inherit;">second</em> quarter of <em style="font: inherit;">2023,</em> <ix:nonFraction id="c141591084" contextRef="d_2023-04-01_2023-06-30_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis-StockRepurchaseProgram2023Member" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockSharesAcquired" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">17,901</ix:nonFraction> shares were purchased under this plan at an average price of $<ix:nonFraction id="c141591085" contextRef="d_2023-04-01_2023-06-30_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis-StockRepurchaseProgram2023Member" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockAcquiredAverageCostPerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">12.89</ix:nonFraction> per share. <ix:nonFraction id="c141591086" contextRef="d_2023-07-01_2023-09-30_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis-StockRepurchaseProgram2023Member" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockSharesAcquired" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="-3">No</ix:nonFraction> shares were purchased during the <em style="font: inherit;">third</em> or <em style="font: inherit;">fourth</em> quarter of <em style="font: inherit;">2023,</em> or during the <em style="font: inherit;">first</em> or&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">second</em> quarter of <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em> under this plan. The plan expired&#160;on <em style="font: inherit;"> May 1, 2024.</em></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
