   </ix:nonNumeric>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -54pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">At <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em>, the Company has unrecognized expense of approximately<span style="background-color:#ffffff;"> $</span><span style="background-color:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction id="c141591147" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_DeferredCompensationArrangementWithIndividualShareBasedPaymentsByTypeOfDeferredCompensationAxis-AfterAmendmentMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognized" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">481,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;</span>for this plan, which it expects to recognize ratably up to&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> February, 2028.</em></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">The <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em> Plan provides for different types of awards including stock options, restricted stock awards, restricted stock units, and performance awards. Under this plan, awards of Eagle&#8217;s common stock <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>be made to eligible directors, officers and employees. The maximum number of shares of stock that <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>be delivered under this plan as of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>is <ix:nonFraction id="c141591149" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_PlanNameAxis-The2025StockIncentivePlanMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">257,578</ix:nonFraction> which includes <ix:nonFraction id="c141591150" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_AwardTypeAxis-RestrictedStockMember_DeferredCompensationArrangementWithIndividualShareBasedPaymentsByTypeOfDeferredCompensationAxis-AfterAmendmentMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">82,578</ix:nonFraction> excess shares transferred from the <em style="font: inherit;">2011</em> Plan upon adoption of the <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em> Plan. During <em style="font: inherit;">2025,</em> the total performance shares awarded under the <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em> Plan were <ix:nonFraction id="c141591155" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31_AwardTypeAxis-PerformanceSharesMember_PlanNameAxis-The2025StockIncentivePlanMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">13,752</ix:nonFraction> based on target level performance. These shares will vest at the end of the <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c141591156">three</span>-year performance period in <em style="font: inherit;"> February, 2028. </em>As of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025, </em><ix:nonFraction id="c141591157" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_AwardTypeAxis-EmployeeStockOptionMember_PlanNameAxis-The2025StockIncentivePlanMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">243,826</ix:nonFraction> shares were available to be awarded under the <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em> Plan.</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">At <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025, </em>the Company has unrecognized expense of approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c141591159" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_PlanNameAxis-The2025StockIncentivePlanMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognized" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">167,000</ix:nonFraction> for this plan, which it expects to recognize ratably up to&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> February, 2028.</em></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">The Company established a nonemployee director award plan effective <em style="font: inherit;"> April 23, 2020.&#160;</em>Under this&#160;plan, awards of Eagle's common stock <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>be made to eligible directors. This plan was amended during <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> and increased the maximum number of shares of restricted stock for issuance under this&#160;plan t<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">o&#160;</span><span style="background-color:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction id="c141591161" contextRef="i_2023-12-31_AwardTypeAxis-RestrictedStockMember_PlanNameAxis-NonemployeeDirectorAwardPlanMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">88,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">.</span> The number of shares of restricted stock available to award under this plan wa<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">s&#160;</span><span style="background-color:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction id="c141591162" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_AwardTypeAxis-RestrictedStockMember_PlanNameAxis-NonemployeeDirectorAwardPlanMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">35,807</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;a</span>s of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em>.</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
